@backend_HostAddress = http://localhost:5002
@api = {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth
@email = someone@example.com

### Get a CSRF request token and cookie before refresh/sign-out.
GET {{api}}/csrf-token
Accept: application/json

### Register. Check Mailpit at http://localhost:8025 and complete the frontend link.
POST {{api}}/sign-up
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "ChangeThis!Password123"
}

### Sign in after confirming the email.
POST {{api}}/sign-in
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "ChangeThis!Password123"
}

### Verify an account using the token from Mailpit.
POST {{api}}/verify-email
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "token": "{{emailConfirmationToken}}"
}

### Request another verification message; response does not reveal account existence.
POST {{api}}/resend-verification
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}"
}

### Refresh. Copy RequestToken from csrf-token response to X-CSRF-TOKEN.
POST {{api}}/refresh-token
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

### Request a password reset; response does not reveal account existence.
POST {{api}}/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}"
}

### Reset the password using userId and token from the Mailpit link.
POST {{api}}/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "token": "{{passwordResetToken}}",
  "newPassword": "NewChangeThis!Password123"
}

### Sign out. Requires a valid access token, refresh cookie, and CSRF request token.
POST {{api}}/sign-out
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

### Revoke every refresh session for the authenticated account.
POST {{api}}/revoke-all-sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Get the authenticated account.
GET {{api}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
